Email & Integrations:
•	SendGrid or SMTP for contact & appointment notifications
•	Google Maps API for Location page
Security & Best Practices:
•	HTTPS-ready
•	Password hashing & role-based authorization
•	Input validation & sanitization
•	CAPTCHA for forms
Deployment:
•	Dockerized
•	Environment variables in .env
•	Ready for Vercel, AWS, Render
