3️⃣ Roles
1.	Admin: Full access to CRUD services, FAQs, users, appointments
2.	Counsellor: Access to appointments, update status, limited editing
3.	Visitor/Student: Can submit forms, book appointments
The website should by default be for visitors hence no need for visitors to login or sign up, the adminand counsellors can have an option in the side menu for staff then when clicked the system first does an email check or a secret key issued to admin and counsellors to confirm that only them can access the other role access. If not listed or not the passkey the user is sent back to the landing page. If accurate they can now proceed to the login page
